{'symbol': 'ARE', 'date': '2022-06-07 16:05:00', 'title': 'ALEXANDRIA REAL ESTATE EQUITIES, INC. EARNS FIFTH CONSECUTIVE AND SEVENTH OVERALL NAREIT INVESTOR CARE AWARD FOR EXCELLENCE IN COMMUNICATIONS AND REPORTING', 'text': 'PASADENA, CALIF. , JUNE 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ALEXANDRIA REAL ESTATE EQUITIES, INC. (NYSE: ARE), AN URBAN OFFICE REIT AND THE FIRST, LONGEST-TENURED AND PIONEERING OWNER, OPERATOR AND DEVELOPER\xa0UNIQUELY FOCUSED ON COLLABORATIVE LIFE SCIENCE, AGTECH AND TECHNOLOGY CAMPUSES IN AAA INNOVATION CLUSTER LOCATIONS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS RECEIVED THE 2022 NAREIT INVESTOR CARE SILVER AWARD IN THE LARGE CAP EQUITY REIT CATEGORY FOR SUPERIOR SHAREHOLDER COMMUNICATIONS AND REPORTING.'}